    <h1>I'm Joe Ruotolo.</h1>
    <p class="lede">I coach teens through SAT and ACT test anxiety — the score problem and the nervous-system problem underneath it, together.</p>
    <img class="bio-photo" src="/assets/img/joe-ruotolo-speaking.jpg" alt="Joe Ruotolo speaking on stage" width="1000" height="833">
